  "edits": [
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00033",
      "source_hash": "3c2687cab87211d72ce6adf3f1bf48f016c7495f62ede0bb3ad4b306d2cb2036",
      "text": "卖淫〔 〕"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00034",
      "source_hash": "7d33749b9559d608aeeb48361dd6a03eba7070772f86346b8dcb9ca5bf8a79b5",
      "text": "性剥削〔 〕"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00035",
      "source_hash": "839bed5dd8ab9525f82c78971a6f760c36904655efc2656a70e6355ac6fe2b6b",
      "text": "劳动剥削〔 〕"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00036",
      "source_hash": "eeeeb7c956071ba308164b41394bb1d1fc50ea94d61dd35254d5ed5fe4f8d839",
      "text": "其他剥削〔 〕"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00037",
      "source_hash": "d04a9d75214738831b9f2ad47a5ca9908c5ea475ee43613a2a6bda552307b8ec",
      "text": "受害情况"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00038",
      "source_hash": "a0f3333753ded84c9d11d8417233bd08165ffd69ff22ee2b3dc48fae4696ed3b",
      "text": "主要内容"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00039",
      "source_hash": "795d2bd7018e2ec269b02d0b841e5f376597c11688b89219a1e58b0647677529",
      "text": "※请依据《防止人口贩运等及保护受害者等法》第二条第一项规定的人口贩运等行为，"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00040",
      "source_hash": "e71fd4b4daa3f9eb02b830deb82ace06c3771f9e5a7e5e94a729d37587cfa66b",
      "text": "按照何人、何时、何地、何事、为何及如何等原则详细填写受害经过与内容，以便判定其属于人口贩运等造成的受害。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00041",
      "source_hash": "12a80fea3deffab367a16161e3dfb420f0a9d13435b15e8434a195bccacdf441",
      "text": "（填写空间不足时，请另附纸张。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00042",
      "source_hash": "f9fbf981939c168b9838ed8df7022573b4e576f817b3a5d7f89e9ecd8bc10b60",
      "text": "依照《防止人口贩运等及保护受害者等法》第十四条第一款、同法施行令第七条第一款及"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00043",
      "source_hash": "919be5b990b6f18fcfddc9b032252238eb16a4d2802a7f7bc42ee008496c0c1f",
      "text": "同法施行规则第三条第一款，申请签发受害者确认书。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00047",
      "source_hash": "d18875e1fa5508fbd63ab68f1bdc871134b418fb8069e19c5a5d3b64327c2254",
      "text": "申请人"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00049",
      "source_hash": "485c7190387165642eed07cc43925dbbe4751fd55bb9574665eea55ddbf26f59",
      "text": "中央人口贩运等受害者"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00050",
      "source_hash": "2099cd7f323c38ac89f0ebc4dd140529ccb048fb87aa42935038b81b0325020d",
      "text": "致"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00051",
      "source_hash": "be0ecbe0fce3773093fe5cd4e87eb308db06316e3946c0e06016e6e5d384dd72",
      "text": "权益保护机构负责人"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00052",
      "source_hash": "d6d87e05c543e71cabaccf3ed61804e7e814d1a465e94f4fdc59f331ba61f822",
      "text": "（背面）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00053",
      "source_hash": "415c12cfe236ffa5094f9e3a7709063457a807995edc8ff53226e774fda2c5bd",
      "text": "随附文件"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00054",
      "source_hash": "19995b9f2995ecd828c36601da915a84fb081ba31452fa01c394a563f7137db4",
      "text": "1. 居民登记证、驾驶证、护照、外国人登记证等公共机构签发的能够确认本人身份的证件"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00055",
      "source_hash": "0313408cdf794fea03a1b1d6758e8ad6cc7c6a9f70b7256de98dafab6a45bf1a",
      "text": "手续费"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00056",
      "source_hash": "5e77e25a6f857ec3e92cfd0cba4606819c1411377828763adac3c5cc297b485e",
      "text": "复印件一份"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00057",
      "source_hash": "a7c6e233ecbe313fed09cd72cde0f5623ba99a933a926a1e601ed626540d9e08",
      "text": "无"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00059",
      "source_hash": "11160c3b9ff73b01ab2e91766f849c8fe95896e60b4304ccb116ed19e5875274",
      "text": "2. 依照《家庭关系登记等相关法律》第十五条第一款第一项签发的家庭关系证明书等能够确认家庭关系的"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00060",
      "source_hash": "b2bde5d0cd36f30892232ebbaab7b8e304c3eadd08297707e384737c1da21ca9",
      "text": "文件一份"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00061",
      "source_hash": "3ef1ad5cc1f1bff450f69981afad74e43d29a3717515d636fcf527f53b39dedc",
      "text": "3. 诊断书（仅限存在与人口贩运等直接相关的伤害或疾病）一份"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00062",
      "source_hash": "5272e3456df670ab9d4f443e69801b43805ce749ab936cf677a9e1576403bd1a",
      "text": "4. 出入境事实证明书（仅限人口贩运等受害者为外国人的情形）一份"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00063",
      "source_hash": "37eff570e2115b061f6cd3ede2ee99eef3630deb7c3dfa04689f0031b708cac1",
      "text": "5. 劳动合同等证明就业的文件（仅限劳动者）一份"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26693-zh-00064",
      "source_hash": "54e2b99c4fd7c98c4ff7cffe727889822bf5712a20a875d36656eb9ceb9d4e5b",
      "text": "6. 其他能够证明申请人系人口贩运等受害者的资料一份"
    }
  ],
  "note": "Checked Korean first/second page form excerpts; corrected victimization categories, references to single trafficking law, application signature, addressee, no-fee label and attachments list. Existing clear labels kept."
}